t 3 three-point attempts. I am skeptical: about 0.3 made threes in the median and more in the ceiling.","sources":["https://youtu.be/p9XE5jFqhvs?t=1658"]},{"field":"multipliers.stl","text":"Fantrax's 1.2 steals pulls the base down. The other sources and last season are at about 2.0. He leads his group in deflections.","sources":["stats","https://youtu.be/_O9pc_u5vH0?t=886"]},{"field":"multipliers.fg_pct","text":"More self-creation, where his efficiency is below league average, costs a little FG%.","sources":["https://youtu.be/p9XE5jFqhvs?t=1287"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}